{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 39, :comments ["<b>For it was not leavened.</b> For it did not become leavened, because of the shortness of the time from the hour of their journey from Rameses — which is in the land of Egypt — until they reached Sukkot, which is outside their border, as the Sages said: 'Their dough had no time to become leavened until He was revealed upon them,' etc. For indeed, when they were in Sukkot, outside the border of Egypt, the pillars of cloud and fire were revealed upon them, and YHWH went before them (Exodus 13:21)."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:25:17.091110584Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}